
# █▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀▀█
# █
# █ .gitignore
# █
# █▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄█

# How to Use
# ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

# Allowlist strategy: ignore everything, then explicitly allow what belongs.
# This prevents accidental commits of new files or folders.
#
# Pattern reference:
#   /foo    — root only
#   foo/    — folders only
#   *       — any chars (no /)
#   ?       — any single char (no /)
#   **/     — any depth of folders
#   /**     — everything inside
#   a/**/b — anything between a and b

# Rules
# ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

# ignore ALL files & folders
*

# Whitelist
# ▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬

# project files
# ——————————————————————————————

# root project files
!/*.*
!/LICENSE
# allow .gitignore, .gitattributes, .gitmodules
!/.git?*

# continuous integration
# ——————————————————————————————

# workflows and the composite actions they call. Package-scoped actions live
# under their own package and are already covered by its whitelist entry.
!/.github/
!/.github/**

# IDE
# ——————————————————————————————

!/.vscode/
!/.vscode/**

# coding agents
# ——————————————————————————————

!/.claude*/
!/.claude*/**

# ignore local overrides
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/claude.local.md

# source code
# ——————————————————————————————

!/src
!/src/**

# Third-party submodules are registered with `git submodule add -f`; once
# registered, this rule no longer applies to them. It stops an unregistered
# folder being committed as ordinary files.
/src/.submodules/*/

# Blacklist
# ▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬

**/.git

# dependencies
# ——————————————————————————————

**/node_modules/
**/roku_modules/

# artifacts
# ——————————————————————————————

**/.artifacts/
**/build/
**/dist/
**/out/

**/.wrangler/
**/.dev.vars

# secrets
# ——————————————————————————————

**/.env*
**/.env*.bak
# allow example file
!**/.env*.example

# Encrypted with age, so the ciphertext is safe to commit; the plaintext it
# came from never is.
!**/*.age
!/.age-recipients

# generated output
# ——————————————————————————————

# an analyzed app's own output (cli.analyze-app.mjs, e.g.
# src/apps/roku-app/graphify-output/)
**/graphify-output/

# code-review-graph generated files
**/.code-review-graph/

# links this checkout's dependencies to sibling checkouts (packager)
**/package-local.json
